    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Ahabu akaba aine abatabani makumi mushanju omuri Samaria. Yehu yaahandiika ebaruha, yaazitwekyera abategyeki b'orurembo Samaria, n'abakuru baarwo, kandi n'abarezi ba beene Ahabu, naabagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi baruha ku eraabahikye eti, nk'oku mwine batabani ba mukama waanyu, kandi mukagira ebigaari n'embaraasi n'endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare n'eby'okurwanisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutoorane omuri batabani ba mukama waanyu orikukira abandi boona, kandi ohikire, mumute aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa ishe, murwanirire enju ya mukama waanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka baatiina munonga, baagira bati. Ku araabe atabaasiibwe abo bagabe bombi, itwe nitubaasa tuta kumuza omu kaso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo omutegyeki w'ekikaari n'ow'orurembo hamwe n'abakuru n'abo barezi b'abaana, baatuma ahari Yehu nibagira bati: Turi abairu baawe; nitwija kukora ebi oraaturagiire byona; kandi titwine muntu weena ou turaayemekye; kureka iwe okore eki orikusiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagaruka yaabahandiikira ebaruha ya kabiri, naagira ati: Ku muraabe muri abangye, kandi mweteekateekire kuunyorobera, mutemeho batabani ba mukama waanyu emitwe, nyencakare nk'aga magingo muginshangise Yezereeli. Obwo bunaku batabani b'omugabe boona makumi mushanju bakaba bari hamwe n'abakuru b'orurembo, abaabaire nibabarera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 21:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Egyo baruha ku yaabahikire, baakwata batabani b'omugabe, baabaita boona makumi mushanju, emitwe yaabo baagita omu bitukuru, baagimutwekyera Yezereeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entumwa yaija, yaamugira eti: Emitwe y'abaana b'omugabe baagireeta. Yaagira ati: Mugirunde ebirundo bibiri aha irembo egumeho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 9:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu kasheeshe ku yaashohoire, yaayemerera omu maisho g'abantu boona, yaabagira ati: Imwe timwine urbanja; niinye ngomeire mukama wangye, nkamwita; mbwenu nimugira ngu oitsire aba boona, n'oha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 21:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo mumanye ku hatariho kigambo na kimwe eki MUKAMA yaagambire aha nju ya Ahabu ekiribura; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahikiriize eki yaagambire naaraba omu mwiru we Eliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehu yaita boona abaabaire batsigaire omu nju ya Ahabu omuri Yezereeli, abashaija be ab'aha mara, n'abanyamurwa be; tiyaatsigaho na waakizira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehu yaarugayo, yaaza Samaria; ku yaabaire akiri omu muhanda, yaahika aha nju y'eikyemuriro ry'ebyoya by'entaama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.22.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 22:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaabugana ab'oruganda rwa Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda, yaabuuza ati: Muri baahi? Baamugarukamu bati: Turi ab'oruganda rwa Ahazia, twizire kutaayaayira abaana b'omugabe n'aba nyin'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagira ati: Mubakwate bahuriire. Baabakwata bahuriire, baabaitira aha kiina ky'enju y'eikyemuriro ry'ebyoya by'entaama, boona makumi ana na babiri, tiyaatsigaho n'omwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
