            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaarugire aho, yaabugana Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu, aizire kumubugana, yaamuramutsya, yaamubuuza ati: Omutima gwawe ni mwere, nk'oku ogwagye guri mwere ahariiwe? Yehonadabu yaamugarukamu ati: Nikwo guri. Onu ati: Ku guraabe nikwo guri, mpa engaro. Atyo yaazimuha. Onu yaamutembya omu kigaari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaamugira ati: Ija tugyende, oreebe obweziriki bwangye ahabwa MUKAMA. Atyo yaamutwara omu kigaari kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaahikire Samaria, yaita aba Ahabu boona abaabaire batsigaire Samaria, okuhitsya obu yaabamazireho, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA, eki yaagambiire Eliya, oku kyabaire kiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
