          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okutandikira Yorudani nootoora oburugwa-izooba, ensi yoona eya Gileadi, n'ey'Abagaadi, n'ey'Abareubeni, n'ey'Abamanaase, okuruga Aroeri, ey'omu ruhita rwa Arunooni, niyo Gileadi na Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endiijo mirimo ya Yehu n'ebi yaakozire byona, n'eby'amaani ge goona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yehu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika Samaria. Yehoahazi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi emyaka ei Yehu yaamazire aha ngoma naategyeka Israeli omuri Samaria ekahika makumi abiri na munaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.36"
            ]
          }
